      612.61,
      523.36,
      672.08
    ],
    "text": "The story of the prosecution is that on the fateful day the sole eye-witness W. Shirani (The daughter of the deceased) went with her mother to a nearby well to fetch water. She saw Wadu Sira and the 2nd",
