  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.22,
      311.41,
      515.56,
      432.33
    ],
    "text": "Prosecution Witness Inspector Ananda testifies that when he visited the scene of the crime, he found the deceased lying behind the community hall with head injuries. There, he has also observed that there was a tube-well in the vicinity. When the defence was called after the case for the prosecution was closed, the 1st Appellant had denied any involvement to the incident and has testified that Wadu",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
