      83.87,
      117.3,
      515.68,
      198.15
    ],
    "text": "The evidence of Nirosha meets the tests of promptitude and consistency and further a question arises as to why the prosecution tried to suppress the evidence of the above-mentioned witness whose evidence is favourable to the defence.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.877156257629395,
      14.96585464477539,
