    "bbox": [
      83.94,
      450.17,
      515.11,
      510.87
    ],
    "text": "F or the foregoing reasons, I am inclined to agree with the submissions advanced by the counsel for the Appellants and proceed to allow the appeal and set aside the conviction and the sentence dated 06.03.2012.",
